#: logout.C:52
msgid ""
"The following applications contain unsaved data which\n"
"will be lost in your next session."
msgstr ""
"Les programes ciddé ont des doneyes nén co schapeyes ;\n"
"ele seront pierduwes cwand vos rvénroz."

#: logout.C:63
msgid ""
"The following applications cannot be restored in your next session,\n"
"only restarted. Make sure they do not contain important unsaved data."
msgstr ""
"Les programes ciddé ni sårint esse renondés tot seus cwand vos rvénroz.\n"
"Estoz sheur(e)  k' i gn a nole doneye nén schapeye ki vos vôrîz wårder?"

#: logout.C:74
msgid ""
"The following applications are not X11-aware and though cannot be restored\n"
"in your next session. Make sure they do not contain important unsaved data."
msgstr ""
"Les programes ciddé ni cnoxhèt nén X11. I n' si sårint renonder tot seu\n"
"cwand vos rvénroz. Estoz sheur(e)  k' i gn a nole doneye nén\n"
"schapeye ki vos vôrîz wårder?."

